{
	// Origin Story: the player's ordinary day in 2026, which shapes their skills and history,
	// until a stranger straps a device to their wrist and it carries them to a safe house in
	// 2087. Its rows sit left of the Titanic's, whose orders start at 1 (negative orders
	// aren't shown).
	"locationsBaseOrder":25,
	
